  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. It's given that <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 16 Over x EndFraction\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"17\"><mn>17</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in this function yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 17 right parenthesis equals StartFraction 16 Over 17 EndFraction\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>17</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>17</mn></mfrac></math>. Therefore, when <math alttext=\"x equals 17\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>17</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"StartFraction 16 Over 17 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>17</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of the reciprocal of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 17\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>17</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 1\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 17\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>17</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>",
